e},{"text":"你为何沮丧？为何在我里面烦躁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要仰望上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我还要赞美祂——我的救主，我的上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}